# =============================================================================
# BiLSTM-Model — long-lived .gitignore
# Python · TensorFlow · CustomTkinter · local data & trained artifacts
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trained models & checkpoints (keep source package `model/` tracked)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
models/
**/checkpoints/
**/saved_model/
*.keras
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pb
*.tflite
*.lite
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.ckpt.*
checkpoint
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.safetensors
events.out.tfevents.*
**/tensorboard/**
**/logs/**
**/runs/**
**/wandb/
**/mlruns/
**/lightning_logs/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sensor / experiment data (regenerable; do not commit large CSVs)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
sensor_data.csv
*.csv
!requirements*.txt
data/
datasets/
raw/
processed/
exports/
*.npz
*.parquet
*.feather
*.arff

